R2 execution brief for 달팽이 우체부. Approved plan: /Users/seul/Desktop/dotgame-yongdam/.gjc/_session-01a1c41b-d1bb-765e-8fc6-4534210c5554/plans/ralplan/r2-plan/pending-approval.md (sha256 29f8585c...). Sole spec: GAME_DESIGN.md v4 (human-signed) + AGENTS.md. Constraints: implement only what GAME_DESIGN.md v4 says; no Space+arrow move, sound, score, levels 2/3; do not edit AGENTS.md or GAME_DESIGN.md numbers; pure src/logic.js; levels copied from ch.5; sprites/glyphs as palette-index arrays; UI text only in src/strings.js; no webfont; commit prefix goal-N:. Completion = human checks the R2 items in a browser (python3 -m http.server 8000); test pass or fixture screenshots are not evidence. Stop after goal-2 for the human check before goal-3.

@goal: goal-2 letters, mailbox, per-level timer (R2-1..R2-9)
Implement per GAME_DESIGN.md v4 ch.2.1.1/2.2/4/5/6 and the plan sections 5-9 (goal-2 part): parse L and M from the ch.5 level 1 grid (2 letters, 1 mailbox, time limit 30s stored beside the level); push letters with the 0.60s move (letter interpolates linearly, commit at move completion); snail cannot enter mailbox or a blocked push; delivery at move completion removes the letter; timer = remaining ms counting dt-capped game time, displayed as ceil seconds at top-wall-row center using bitmap digit glyphs (palette indices only, no fillText); per-frame order move->delivery->clear->timer->fail; time expiry mid-move discards the move and freezes input (temporary until goal-3). Page starts playing immediately in goal-2 (no title yet). Existing R1 behavior (R1-1..R1-5) must still hold. Unit tests with expected values from the doc, including a solution-replay test (→×7 ↓×3 →×1 ↑×2 clears within 30s). Human check items: R2-1..R2-9.

@goal: goal-3 win/lose and screen flow (R2-10..R2-17)
Implement per GAME_DESIGN.md v4 ch.2.2/3/7 and plan goal-3 part: screens title/play/clear/fail derived from state; Enter starts play (direction input in that frame discarded), timer starts at play entry; clear on last delivery (clear beats same-frame timeout); fail at 0; R restarts per ch.2.2/3 (ignored on title, ignores Ctrl/Meta+R); src/strings.js with the exact texts; bitmap glyphs for the 17 Korean chars, Enter letters and digits (Korean 12x12, Latin/digits 6x12), palette colors only. Human check items: R2-10..R2-17.
